<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15279" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ef-fringo</span></b> , frēgi, fractum,
		3, v. a. and n.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to break off</i>, <i>to break open</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">effringere quam aperire putant robustius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 2, 12, 1</span></i>
			 (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cardines foribus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Am. 4, 2, 6</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. As. 2, 3, 8</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">more freq.: fores,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Stich. 2, 2, 3</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Bacch. 4, 2, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Mil. 4,
				6, 35</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ter. Ad. 1, 2, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">23</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">40</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 4, 23</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">valvas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 43</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">januam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Mur. 15, 33</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tabernas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Ner. 26</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carcerem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					1, 21</span></i>
			: cistam, * <i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 17,
			54</span></i>; <b>poet.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">urbem,</span>”
				<i>to storm</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 9, 556</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Vulg. Judith, 2, 3</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">jugum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Tr. 5, 2, 40</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cerebrum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 5, 480</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corpus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Phoen. 159</span></i>
			; cf. <b>poet.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Herc. Oet. 1451</span></i>
			.—*</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to break out</i>, <i>break forth</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(spumeus fluctus) vestras effringet in urbes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					1, 647</span></i>
			.</div>
